# Excluded from the packed .mcpb bundle.
#
# The bundle is a `uv` extension (manifest.json, server.type "uv"): it ships
# manifest.json, pyproject.toml and src/, and uv resolves the dependencies on
# the user's machine at first launch. Per the MCPB spec a uv bundle must NOT
# contain a vendored lib/ or venv/ — bundling compiled wheels (pandas, pyarrow,
# pydantic-core) is not portable across platforms or Python versions.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.venv/
.venv-linux/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
dist/
build/
lib/
tests/
scope.md
design.md
MVP.md
*.mcpb
*.dxt
.env
.DS_Store
